{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54250","headline":"六合怀古诗 儒学旧基 · 郏滂","name":"六合怀古诗 儒学旧基","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"牛市街中儒祖庙，衣冠俎豆五经书。\n不知殿宅今存否？双桧苍虬耸碧虚。\n（〖1〗《嘉靖志》题注：「《嘉定志》：儒学在河南牛市街。\n郏滂时学己迁。\n其地有杜荀鹤所植偃松二。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郏滂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54250.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54250","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}